# The images build everything from source inside a multi-stage build, so the
# host's generated and vendored files must not enter the build context. Sending
# them would bloat the context upload, and a stale host dist could otherwise
# shadow the fresh compile.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
services/api/public
.git
.github
.nodespec
*.log
npm-debug.log*
